Stage 9: Export Joy of VEX dataset to Synapse RAG knowledge format.

Reads the final JSONL, deduplicates, routes records into 15 thematic
markdown reference files, and updates Synapse metadata (semantic_index.json,
agent_relevance_map.json) via merge -- never overwriting existing entries.

Usage:
    python scripts/09_synapse_export.py [--synapse-rag PATH] [--dry-run]

Output:
    Synapse/rag/skills/houdini21-reference/joy_of_vex_*.md   (15 files)
    Synapse/rag/documentation/_metadata/semantic_index.json   (15 new topics merged)
    Synapse/rag/documentation/_metadata/agent_relevance_map.json  (15 new entries merged)
"""

